            "body": "I see this development as an \"intermediate state\" thing not as the final decision, like a vim.archive refactor eliminating these lua-side plugins could totally happen before the next release.\n\nMy main argument, though, is circumstantial. This will take me a week just enough time before my nvim gardening leave. vim.archive is too much. Point being I think this would leave future developers with a better place to start than nothing for vim.archive\n",
